# "Nongreen" is a word of Thrun's text (CR 612.2). On turn 3, Bot2's Giant Growth (green) targets Thrun (8/8). Bot1 then
# casts Trait Doctoring on its own Thrun, replacing green with blue until end of turn: Thrun now can't be the target of
# nonblue spells Bot2 controls, so Bot2's second Giant Growth can't target it - though it is on offer at Bot2's
# Ornithopter - and Bot2's blue Unsummon can, returning Thrun to Bot1's hand.

[Bot1 Deck]
Forest
Mox Sapphire
Forest
Black Lotus
Trait Doctoring
Thrun, Breaker of Silence
Forest
Forest
Forest x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Emerald
Mox Emerald
Mox Sapphire
Ornithopter
Giant Growth
Giant Growth
Unsummon
Island
Island x12

