Bot1.Hand.Thrun, Breaker of Silence.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Giant Growth.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Thrun, Breaker of Silence)
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Thrun, Breaker of Silence.Power = 8
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Trait Doctoring.Cast(Thrun, Breaker of Silence)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Modes(Replace a color word)
Bot1.Colors(Green)
Bot1.Colors(Blue)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Emerald#2.Activate
! Bot2.Hand.Giant Growth.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Thrun, Breaker of Silence)
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Unsummon.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Thrun, Breaker of Silence)
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass

